div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Structural modelling</h3><p>Columns, walls, slabs, beams and transfer elements modelled to the agreed LOD.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Coordination</h3><p>Openings, sleeves and penetrations agreed with architecture and MEP before issue.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap pn\">\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/architectural-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Curved glass curtain wall facade\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Previous service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Architectural BIM</h2></a>\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/mep-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Engineer inspecting red fire protection pipework in a plant room\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Next service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">MEP BIM</h2></a>\n</div></section>\n","